'''Jerry''' is a special Mayoral Candidate that, while elected, is located in the [[Community Center]], which can be found in front of the [[Hub Island|Hub]] spawn. Jerry is one of three special candidates that appear rarely.  

== Mayoral Perks ==
{{MayorPerks|Jerry}}

=== Perkpocalypse ===
{{Main|Candidate Jerry/Perkpocalypse}}
The {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} ability will give a set of perks from another mayor, and it rotates every 6 Earth hours (18 SkyBlock days). Selected regular mayors are included in the {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} rotation, ordered randomly each time Jerry is elected. See [[Candidate Jerry/Perkpocalypse]] for detailed {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} time slots for each one of Jerry's mayor term.

Mayors that are included in the {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} rotation are:
* {{NPCSprite|Aatrox}}
* {{NPCSprite|Cole}}
* {{NPCSprite|Diana}}
* {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}} (excluding [[Grand Feast]])
* {{NPCSprite|Marina}}
* {{NPCSprite|Paul}}

=== Statspocalypse ===
This perk provides a {{Green|10%}} buff to the [[Stats#Combat|{{Red|Combat}}]] and [[Stats#Miscellaneous Stats|{{Aqua|Miscellaneous}}]] stats ({{Additive}}).

=== Jerrypocalypse ===
{{Main|Jerry Box|Hidden Jerry}}
* Mining, farming crops, felling trees and killing mobs has a small chance to spawn a Green, Blue, Purple or Golden Jerry. When killing a [[Hidden Jerry]], it drops its respective [[Jerry Box]]. After spawning a Jerry, there is a {{Green|6}} minute cooldown before another Jerry can spawn.
* Unlike most other similar events, the {{Pink|Jerrypocalypse}} will also trigger on players' [[Private Island]]s from relevant activities.
* Your profile must have at least {{Green|4 hours}} of playtime to participate in {{Pink|Jerrypocalypse}}.

Items from Jerry Boxes are:
* {{Item|Green Jerry Talisman}}
* {{Item|Jerry Stone}}
* {{Item|Jerry Rune}}
* {{Item|Jerry Candy}}
* {{Item|Jerry 3D Glasses}}
* {{Item|Jerry-chine Gun}}

