== Trivia ==
*{{NPCSprite|Diaz}} and {{NPCSprite|Foxy}} are the only regular mayor candidates who are not in Jerry's {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} mayor rotation.
*You cannot obtain the {{Item|Ancestral Spade}} and {{Item|Griffin Pet}} when {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry}} has {{NPCSprite|Diana}}'s perks.
*In SkyBlock Year 161, when Jerry was mayor and had the {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} mayor rotation of {{NPCSprite|Cole}}, some lobbies in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} still had the [[Mining Fiesta]] perks active even though it ended.
*In SkyBlock Year 233 and 257, although {{NPCSprite|Candidate Barry;Barry}} is no longer a mayor candidate, when Jerry was mayor, {{NPCSprite|Candidate Barry}} was still in [[Candidate Jerry/Perkpocalypse|the Perkpocalypse Mayor Rotation]].
**Hidden perks were not shown for on the {{Pink|Perkpocalypse}} mayor rotation of {{NPCSprite|Barry}}. His hidden perks are believed to be not active.

